Q: What type should I use for a regular &quot;payload-less&quot; action when using Redux Toolkit with Typescript? A: <p>Yes, <code>PayloadAction&lt;void&gt;</code> is the answer, but since you're using <code>createSlice</code>, you can drop the <code>action</code> parameter entirely:</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>reducers: {
    SOME_ACTION(state) {
      state.loading = true;
    }
  }
</code></pre>
<p>That implicitly makes the action <code>PayloadAction&lt;void&gt;</code>.</p>

